2026-07-27T10:44:37.5229075Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:44:37.5229473Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:44:37.5230064Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:44:37.5230948Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:44:37.5231867Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
